cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "StickForStats"
abstract: >-
  A statistical analysis platform with automatic assumption validation
  via the Guardian system, autonomous test selection, manuscript
  statistical review, and multi-tenant collaboration. Designed for
  researchers who need rigorous, reproducible statistical analyses
  without deep statistical expertise.
