# The VERSION DOI for v1.2.0 does not exist until the GitHub release is created and
# Zenodo archives this tag; Zenodo mints it at that moment. The v1.1.0 version DOI
# (10.5281/zenodo.21258382) was here and would have been a false identifier for this
# release, so it is removed rather than guessed at. Add the real one back as an
# `identifiers` entry once Zenodo returns it — see
# paper/bmc_bioinformatics/SUBMISSION_STEPS.md, which sequences this.
